 "note": "Arabic for the series CBE never named in Arabic. CBE publishes title_ar for the Excel archive and for nothing else, which leaves 223 series unnamed -- every FX rate, every policy rate, every treasury bill, all of inflation, which is to say everything on the front page. These are ours, not the Bank's, and build_exports.py marks them title_ar_source: miqyas so the site can say so.",
